<title>USA: Avalon says will sell 2.74 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Avalon says will sell 2.74 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avalon Properties Inc said Monday it agreed to sell 2.74 million shares of common stock to Dutch pension fund Stichting Pensioenfonds ABP.</p>
<p>The company said it sold the stock under its existing shelf registration statement at a purchase price of $27.375 per share.</p>
<p>Avalon said the aggregate purchase price of the sale was $75,007,500, and the settlement date is April 17, 1997.</p>
<p>The company said it intends to use the net cash proceeds from the sale, about $73,5 million, to retire indebtedness under its unsecured credit facilities.</p>
</text>
